{"AitoClientSocialInput": {"description": "The optional social channel, shared by create and update.\n\nHandle validation is deliberately just \"non-empty after trimming\": a\nWhatsApp handle is a phone number and an Instagram one is not, and four\npatterns for platforms we do not control would drift. Nothing downstream\nturns the value into a link, so a value we cannot parse costs nothing.", "properties": {"client_social_handle": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 100, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Client Social Handle"}, "client_social_network": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 20, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Client Social Network"}}, "title": "AitoClientSocialInput", "type": "object"}, "AitoEventPage": {"$defs": {"AitoEventResponse": {"properties": {"actor_class": {"title": "Actor Class", "type": "string"}, "actor_name": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Actor Name"}, "changes": {"anyOf": [{"items": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object"}, "type": "array"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Changes"}, "detail": {"anyOf": [{"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Detail"}, "id": {"title": "Id", "type": "integer"}, "kind": {"title": "Kind", "type": "string"}, "note": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Note"}, "occurred_at": {"format": "date-time", "title": "Occurred At", "type": "string"}, "occurred_until": {"anyOf": [{"format": "date-time", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Occurred Until"}, "subject_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Subject Id"}, "subject_label": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Subject Label"}, "subject_type": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Subject Type"}}, "required": ["id", "occurred_at", "occurred_until", "kind", "actor_class", "actor_name", "subject_type", "subject_id", "subject_label", "changes", "detail", "note"], "title": "AitoEventResponse", "type": "object"}}, "properties": {"events": {"items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/AitoEventResponse"}, "title": "Events", "type": "array"}, "has_more": {"title": "Has More", "type": "boolean"}}, "required": ["events", "has_more"], "title": "AitoEventPage", "type": "object"}, "AitoEventResponse": {"properties": {"actor_class": {"title": "Actor Class", "type": "string"}, "actor_name": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Actor Name"}, "changes": {"anyOf": [{"items": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object"}, "type": "array"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Changes"}, "detail": {"anyOf": [{"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Detail"}, "id": {"title": "Id", "type": "integer"}, "kind": {"title": "Kind", "type": "string"}, "note": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Note"}, "occurred_at": {"format": "date-time", "title": "Occurred At", "type": "string"}, "occurred_until": {"anyOf": [{"format": "date-time", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Occurred Until"}, "subject_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Subject Id"}, "subject_label": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Subject Label"}, "subject_type": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Subject Type"}}, "required": ["id", "occurred_at", "occurred_until", "kind", "actor_class", "actor_name", "subject_type", "subject_id", "subject_label", "changes", "detail", "note"], "title": "AitoEventResponse", "type": "object"}, "AitoFlagUpdate": {"description": "Body of PATCH /aito/{id}/flag. A single required field: this route\nexists to write exactly one flag, so `exclude_unset` semantics (which\n`AitoProjectUpdate` needs) would only make \"absent\" ambiguous here.\n\n`None` is the third state \u2014 no flag \u2014 not \"leave it alone\".", "properties": {"flag": {"anyOf": [{"enum": ["urgent", "sav", "pause"], "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Flag"}}, "required": ["flag"], "title": "AitoFlagUpdate", "type": "object"}, "AitoInvoiceResponse": {"description": "The Invoice card's contents, read live from Books on panel open.\n\nNot snapshotted onto the project like the quote fields are: an invoice's\ninteresting field is whether it has been PAID, and a stored copy of that\nis wrong the moment the client pays. The trade is that this card needs\nZoho reachable, where the Quote card renders from the database.\n\n``balance`` rides along with ``total`` because \"paid\" is the one thing\nthe operator opening this card wants to know, and Books' ``status`` alone\ndoes not distinguish a part-paid invoice from an unpaid one.", "properties": {"balance": {"title": "Balance", "type": "number"}, "currency_code": {"title": "Currency Code", "type": "string"}, "date": {"title": "Date", "type": "string"}, "due_date": {"title": "Due Date", "type": "string"}, "id": {"title": "Id", "type": "string"}, "invoice_count": {"title": "Invoice Count", "type": "integer"}, "number": {"title": "Number", "type": "string"}, "status": {"title": "Status", "type": "string"}, "total": {"title": "Total", "type": "number"}, "url": {"title": "Url", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["id", "number", "date", "due_date", "total", "balance", "currency_code", "status", "url", "invoice_count"], "title": "AitoInvoiceResponse", "type": "object"}, "AitoNoteCreate": {"description": "The ONLY thing a client may append to the timeline.\n\nDeliberately carries no kind, actor or timestamp: the handler fixes all\nthree. A body that could name its own kind could fabricate an acceptance.", "properties": {"note": {"maxLength": 2000, "minLength": 1, "title": "Note", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["note"], "title": "AitoNoteCreate", "type": "object"}, "AitoProjectCreate": {"$defs": {"AitoTaskCreate": {"properties": {"impression_color": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 100, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Impression Color"}, "impression_cost": {"anyOf": [{"minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Impression Cost"}, "impression_description": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 10000, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Impression Description"}, "impression_discount_pct": {"anyOf": [{"exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 100, "type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Impression Discount Pct"}, "impression_done": {"default": false, "title": "Impression Done", "type": "boolean"}, "impression_filament_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Impression Filament Id"}, "impression_printer_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Impression Printer Id"}, "impression_quantity": {"anyOf": [{"minimum": 1, "type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Impression Quantity"}, "impression_time_min": {"anyOf": [{"minimum": 0, "type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Impression Time Min"}, "impression_weight_g": {"anyOf": [{"minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Impression Weight G"}, "modelisation_cost": {"anyOf": [{"minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Modelisation Cost"}, "modelisation_description": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 10000, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Modelisation Description"}, "modelisation_done": {"default": false, "title": "Modelisation Done", "type": "boolean"}, "scan_cost": {"anyOf": [{"minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Scan Cost"}, "scan_description": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 10000, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Scan Description"}, "scan_done": {"default": false, "title": "Scan Done", "type": "boolean"}, "title": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 200, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Title"}, "usinage_cost": {"anyOf": [{"minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Usinage Cost"}, "usinage_description": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 10000, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Usinage Description"}, "usinage_done": {"default": false, "title": "Usinage Done", "type": "boolean"}}, "title": "AitoTaskCreate", "type": "object"}}, "properties": {"client_email": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 200, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Client Email"}, "client_id": {"minLength": 1, "title": "Client Id", "type": "string"}, "client_is_company": {"anyOf": [{"type": "boolean"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Client Is Company"}, "client_name": {"maxLength": 200, "minLength": 1, "title": "Client Name", "type": "string"}, "client_phone": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 50, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Client Phone"}, "client_social_handle": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 100, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Client Social Handle"}, "client_social_network": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 20, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Client Social Network"}, "description": {"maxLength": 10000, "minLength": 1, "title": "Description", "type": "string"}, "quote_date": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 10, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Quote Date"}, "quote_id": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 50, "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Quote Id"}, "quote_number": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 50, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Quote Number"}, "quote_salesperson": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 200, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Quote Salesperson"}, "quote_status": {"anyOf": [{"enum": ["draft", "sent", "viewed", "accepted", "declined", "expired"], "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Quote Status"}, "quote_total": {"anyOf": [{"minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Quote Total"}, "quote_url": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 300, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Quote Url"}, "shipping_first_name": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 100, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Shipping First Name"}, "shipping_island": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 50, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Shipping Island"}, "shipping_last_name": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 100, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Shipping Last Name"}, "shipping_phone": {"anyOf": [{"maxLength": 50, "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Shipping Phone"}, "shipping_price": {"anyOf": [{"minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Shipping Price"}, "tasks": {"items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/AitoTaskCreate"}, "maxItems": 300, "title": "Tasks", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["description", "client_id", "client_name"], "title": "AitoProjectCreate", "type": "object"}, "AitoProjectImport": {"$defs": {"AitoProjectImportItem": {"properties": {"column": {"enum": ["devis", "waiting", "scan", "model", "print", "finish", "done"], "title": "Column", "type": "string"}, "description": {"maxLength": 10000, "minLength": 1, "title": "Description", "type": "string"}, "position": {"minimum": 0, "title": "Position", "type": "integer"}}, "required": ["description", "column", "position"], "title": "AitoProjectImportItem", "type": "object"}}, "properties": {"projects": {"items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/AitoProjectImportItem"}, "maxItems": 1000, "title": "Projects", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["projects"], "title": "AitoProjectImport", "type": "object"}, "AitoProjectImportItem": {"properties": {"column": {"enum": ["devis", "waiting", "scan", "model", "print", "finish", "done"], "title": "Column", "type": "string"}, "description": {"maxLength": 10000, "minLength": 1, "title": "Description", "type": "string"}, "position": {"minimum": 0, "title": "Position", "type": "integer"}}, "required": ["description", "column", "position"], "title": "AitoProjectImportItem", "type": "object"}, "AitoProjectMove": {"properties": {"column": {"enum": ["devis", "waiting", "scan", "model", "print", "finish", "done"], "title": "Column", "type": "string"}, "position": {"minimum": 0, "title": "Position", "type": "integer"}}, "required": ["column", "position"], "title": "AitoProjectMove", "type": "object"}, "AitoProjectResponse": {"$defs": {"AitoTaskStepsResponse": {"description": "One task's steps, for the board card's per-task rows.\n\nMirrors TaskSteps in services/aito_board_rules.py. Both lists are in\ncanonical SERVICES order; `done` is a subset of `services`, and a service\npriced None appears in neither \u2014 it is absent from the job, not pending.\n`title` is the task's own name, \"\" when it has none \u2014 the frontend\nsupplies the fallback name (\"Task N\") for that case.", "properties": {"done": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "title": "Done", "type": "array"}, "services": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "title": "Services", "type": "array"}, "title": {"default": "", "title": "Title", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["services", "done"], "title": "AitoTaskStepsResponse", "type": "object"}}, "properties": {"client_email": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Client Email"}, "client_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Client Id"}, "client_is_company": {"anyOf": [{"type": "boolean"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Client Is Company"}, "client_name": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Client Name"}, "client_phone": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Client Phone"}, "client_social_handle": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Client Social Handle"}, "client_social_network": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Client Social Network"}, "column": {"enum": ["devis", "waiting", "scan", "model", "print", "finish", "done"], "title": "Column", "type": "string"}, "created_at": {"format": "date-time", "title": "Created At", "type": "string"}, "created_by": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Created By"}, "description": {"title": "Description", "type": "string"}, "flag": {"anyOf": [{"enum": ["urgent", "sav", "pause"], "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Flag"}, "id": {"title": "Id", "type": "integer"}, "move_lock": {"anyOf": [{"enum": ["quote", "waiting", "declined", "steps"], "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Move Lock"}, "position": {"title": "Position", "type": "integer"}, "quote_accepted_at": {"anyOf": [{"format": "date-time", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Quote Accepted At"}, "quote_date": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Quote Date"}, "quote_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Quote Id"}, "quote_invoiced": {"title": "Quote Invoiced", "type": "boolean"}, "quote_number": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Quote Number"}, "quote_salesperson": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Quote Salesperson"}, "quote_status": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Quote Status"}, "quote_status_block": {"anyOf": [{"enum": ["conflict", "rejected"], "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Quote Status Block"}, "quote_status_remote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Quote Status Remote"}, "quote_sync_error": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Quote Sync Error"}, "quote_sync_state": {"title": "Quote Sync State", "type": "string"}, "quote_total": {"anyOf": [{"type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Quote Total"}, "quote_url